{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Race or Crash: Secret Racer League",
    "steam_appid": 3251510,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through your rivals and destroy their cars to reach the finish line first! But it's not that simple! In this place, people are telling some <strong>strange things</strong>\u2026 You have to find out what the hell they are talkin' about!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The local racers tell tales that there is somebody besides you all on this mountain. This' pretty bizarre since there are no signs of anybody's presence! Don't be na\u00efve: win in all the races and find out who that secret person is! You are a racer after all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to impress your rivals by your amazing car, you can choose 1 of the 3 kinds of vinyls almost for every car! You should never forget about your own uniqueness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also can join the professionals' club by choosing the manual transmission mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's exactly what I'm talking about - being an example of a great driver! I'm sure you'll get what you want! FORWARD, MY FRIEND!!!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Break through your rivals and destroy their cars to reach the finish line first! But it's not that simple! In this place, people are telling some <strong>strange things</strong>\u2026 You have to find out what the hell they are talkin' about!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The local racers tell tales that there is somebody besides you all on this mountain. This' pretty bizarre since there are no signs of anybody's presence! Don't be na\u00efve: win in all the races and find out who that secret person is! You are a racer after all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In order to impress your rivals by your amazing car, you can choose 1 of the 3 kinds of vinyls almost for every car! You should never forget about your own uniqueness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You also can join the professionals' club by choosing the manual transmission mode!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That's exactly what I'm talking about - being an example of a great driver! I'm sure you'll get what you want! FORWARD, MY FRIEND!!!</p>",
    "short_description": "Race or Crash is a Combat-Racing game, where you can smash into your enemies drivin' your musclecar! You also can choose manual or automatic gear switching! Some nonsense happens here &amp; you need to find out what's goin' on on this goddamn mountain! C'mon, dude!!!",
    "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Polish, Russian, Czech, Tatar, Danish, Finnish, Portuguese - Brazil, Turkish, Ukrainian, Kazakh",
